Subject: [PATCH] perf(entity): stream bounded pushable collision queries

Port of Leaf commit cc2a6fdfdec6245b9084b8860bdcbbbd7ddf04e6.

Original author: HaHaWTH/Creeam <102713261+HaHaWTH@users.noreply.github.com>
Original license: MIT
Source: https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf/commit/cc2a6fdfdec6245b9084b8860bdcbbbd7ddf04e6

Stream only LivingEntity push candidates. The visitor keeps Lattice's Moonrise
section and storage order, then processes PlatformHooks additions in their existing order.
It aborts only once both the collision cap and cramming's non-passenger decision
have resolved.

